    "summary": "New src/db/graph/__tests__/lmdb-txn-semantics.test.ts pins lmdb's behaviour (read back in a fresh node process after a reopen: root.transaction keeps a throwing callback's write, childTransaction and transactionSync discard it) and checks the store opens without writemap mode (a real childTransaction on a store-module store). Falsifying mutations recorded in docs/standalone/graph-store-write-transaction-whose-callback-E202610165437d6e5/S001/evidence/t3-suites.md: child case switched to root.transaction fails the pin; useWritemap: true fails the open test with lmdb's own message. src/db suites 520/520 at commit a6b80446. The lock-loss suites are unchanged files and pass.",
